OL,3,GNEWSASixth form to offer latest range
OL,4,Aof qualifications
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn island sixth form will be offering
OL,7,Fthe latest vocational qualifications as
OL,8,Fpart of a more varied programme of
OL,9,Foptions from September 2027.
OL,11,FBlanchelande College, an independent
OL,12,Fco-educational school, will launch
OL,13,FV-levels in education, and finance and
OL,14,Faccounting.
OL,16,FThe college says the option will enable
OL,17,Fstudents to combine career-focused
OL,18,Fstudy with A-levels, broadening the
OL,19,Fpossibilities for pupils who want to
OL,20,Fmix academic and practical learning.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
