OL,3,GNEWSASixth form to offer latest range
OL,4,Aof qualifications
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrincipal Alexa Yeoman described the
OL,7,Fchanges to come as "an exciting
OL,8,Fdevelopment not only for our students,
OL,9,Fbut for Guernsey as a whole".
